    # MC @ angry "Easy to say now, not so much when the daggers are drawn and surrounding you."
    MC @ angry "지금 말하기는 쉽지, 단검이 뽑혀 널 둘러싸면 그리 쉽지 않겠지만."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:18
