    MC @ talk "그럼 네가 그들을 하나로 묶지 못할 때는 어쩌지?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:27
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_5_evidence_5ea0bac2:

    # TAREK "What are you talking about?"
