# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:37
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_5_evidence_7be73ad4:

    # TAREK "Then I will just bring them back into line once I return!"
    TAREK "그럼 돌아오자마자 다시 선을 지키게 만들면 돼!"

