    # "Tarek pondered the thought for a moment, his eyes staring into my very soul before he spoke."
    "타렉은 잠시 생각에 잠겨 내 영혼을 꿰뚫는 듯한 눈빛으로 바라보다 입을 열었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:46
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_5_evidence_4feb84c7:

    # TAREK "...You're very strange, normally someone would just try and poison me or something."
    TAREK "...넌 아주 이상하군, 보통 사람들은 그냥 독을 타거나 하려고 하거든."

