    # TAREK "Tsch, are you a holy man or something? Look around you... There's little room left for mercy in this world."
    TAREK "쳇, 성직자라도 되나? 주변을 둘러봐... 이 세상에 자비가 있을 자리는 거의 남지 않았어."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:50
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_5_evidence_5e998718:

    # MC @ talk "You're wrong, there's always time for mercy."
    MC @ talk "틀렸어, 자비를 베풀 시간은 항상 있어."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:51
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_5_evidence_4be23034:

    # TAREK "...{i}*Sigh*{/i} I cannot believe I am agreeing to this, but very well."
    TAREK "...{i}*한숨*{/i} 내가 이걸 동의하다니 믿을 수 없지만, 좋아."

