    MC @ talk "불필요한 유혈사태를 피할 수 있다면, 그렇게 하자."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:82
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_5_evidence_initial_91cfda01:

    # MARKUS "Hmph... Well, next time let me know before you change course suddenly."
    MARKUS "흥... 뭐, 다음번에 갑자기 방향을 바꾸기 전에 미리 알려줘."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:83
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_5_evidence_initial_2fc786d2:

    # MARKUS @ angry "I was ready to leap across the table and go for his throat!"
    MARKUS @ angry "테이블을 뛰어넘어 그의 목을 조를 준비가 되어 있었어!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:84
