    # NIJAH @ angry "I do not understand... Tarek iz bad man, everyone would be better off if he were dead!"
    NIJAH @ angry "이해가 안 가... 타렉은 나쁜 사람이야, 죽으면 모두에게 더 좋을 거야!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_5.rpy:86
